🚀 SKShop – Django E-Commerce Web Application

I developed this full-stack e-commerce web application as a practical implementation of the concepts and skills I learned during my training at IT Vedant Institute.

Throughout my learning journey, I gained hands-on knowledge of Python, Django, Django REST Framework, MySQL, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, REST APIs, authentication, database management and API integration. I implemented these concepts in this project to build a real-world e-commerce application.

In this project, I implemented:

🔐 Phone Number & OTP Authentication
🔑 JWT & Cookie-Based Authentication
🛍️ Product and Category Management
🛒 Shopping Cart & Wishlist
👤 User Profile & Address Management
📦 Order Creation, Management & Tracking
💳 Razorpay Payment Integration
🔔 Notifications
⭐ Product Reviews & Ratings
🧾 PDF Invoice Generation & Download
🤖 Chatbot Functionality
🔌 REST API Development & Integration
🗄️ MySQL Database Management

This project gave me the opportunity to apply my classroom and practical learning to a real-world application, understand how different technologies work together, and improve my skills in backend development and full-stack web development.

Tech Stack: Python | Django | Django REST Framework | MySQL | HTML5 | CSS3 | JavaScript | JWT | Razorpay | ReportLab

